## Usage UI (dashboard)

Runs always-on with gateway at `http://127.0.0.1:4002`. No flag, no standalone command. Loopback only — never via tunnel. Embedded in binary (`embed.FS`); starts/stops with gateway.

### Dashboard panels (user-facing)

Keep README § Usage Dashboard in sync when panels change.

| Panel | What it shows |
| --- | --- |
| System health | Uptime, tunnel mode & public URL, masked gateway key (show/copy for Cursor) |
| Provider balances | Moonshot + DeepSeek live balances via `/api/balances`; blurred by default (Show/Hide) |
| Month projection | Avg daily spend, projected month total, vs last month |
| Month to date | Requests, tokens, estimated cost |
| Spend by period | Stacked bar chart by model; time-range selector + period-over-period % badge |
| Spend by model / provider | Breakdown pie charts |
| Sessions | Collapsible summary row (default) + optional session list; pref `discursive_usageui_sessions_open` |
| Currency | USD / EUR / CNY display toggle (`localStorage`) |

| Decision | Choice |
| --- | --- |
| Package | `internal/usageui` — embedded HTTP server + static assets |
| Address | `127.0.0.1:4002` (loopback only, never via tunnel) |
| Persistence | SQLite at `{dataRoot}/usage/usage.db` (shared with gateway) |
| UI stack | Go `embed.FS` + HTML/CSS/vanilla JS — no React/Vue/npm |
| Charts | Chart.js 4.4.7 — vendored in `static/` (offline) |
| API | `/api/summary`, `/api/by-day-model`, `/api/by-day`, `/api/by-model`, `/api/by-provider`, `/api/sessions`, `/api/balances`, `/api/reasoning-effort`, `/api/settings` (live compression toggles), `/api/verbosity` (per-model deepseek toggles — see `gateway.mdc`) |
| Lifecycle | Start/stop with gateway |

### Currency support

USD/EUR/CNY dropdown. Persisted in `localStorage` (`discursive_currency`). Rates proxied via Go backend `/api/exchange-rate` → `api.frankfurter.app`; cached in `localStorage` (`discursive_fx_rates`, 24h TTL). New currencies: add to `<select>` HTML + `fetchExchangeRate` `?to=` param.

### Provider balances + month projection

Two half-width cards above Month-to-Date (`card-row`). Poll with `refreshAll` (15s).

**Balances** (`GET /api/balances`): server-side proxy with stored upstream keys (never expose keys). Moonshot `GET {base}/users/me/balance` → `available_balance` USD. DeepSeek `GET {base}/user/balance` → prefer USD `total_balance`, else CNY÷FX→USD. Z.AI (GLM Coding Plan): `GET https://api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/quota/limit` → `data.limits[]` array of `CREDIT_LIMIT` buckets with `remaining`/`percentage`. Parse all buckets (e.g., weekly and 5-hour quotas) and display them. Color thresholds always on USD: `<$5` red, `<$15` yellow, `<$100` green, `≥$100` blue. Display via `fmtMoney`.

**Projection**: from MTD `est_usd`. `avgDaily = mtd / UTC dayOfMonth` (includes zero-spend days). `projected = avgDaily × daysInMonth`.

### Period selector

`#time-range` dropdown controls Spend-by-Period window + granularity. Selection persisted in `localStorage` (`discursive_usageui_time_range`).

| Value | Label | Window | Buckets |
| --- | ---- | --- | --- |
| `today` | Today | Midnight → now | 1h each |
| `yesterday` | Yesterday | Previous calendar day | 1h each (24) |
| `this-week` | This Week | Mon midnight → Sun midnight (UTC) | 1d each (7, future days empty) |
| `last-week` | Last Week | Previous Mon midnight → Sun midnight (UTC) | 1d each (7) |
| `this-month` | This Month | 1st → last day of month | 1d each (future days empty) |
| `last-month` | Last Month | 1st → last day of previous month | 1d each |
| `1h`–`30d` | Fixed lookback | N hours/days back from now | Auto-bucketed |

**Boundaries:** All `since`/`until` are midnight UTC via `Date.UTC()`/`utcMidnight()` — server `Truncate(bucketDur)` works in UTC. Never use local-time `toISOString()` for month/week boundaries.

**`until` param:** Bounded periods pass `until` to cap server padding. Server loop is `!t.After(floorUntil)`, so `until` must equal **last** day/hour of range. Example: Mon–Sun week → `until=Sunday` (7 buckets), NOT `until=next Monday` (8).

**Future days** (This Week/This Month): Server pads all buckets from `since`→`until`, zero-cost rows for unused models → empty bars.

### Spend comparison badge

Current periods (`today`/`this-week`/`this-month`) show +/-/% badge vs same time point in previous period:

- **Today** vs yesterday same time-of-day
- **This Week** vs last week same day/time
- **This Month** vs last month same day/time

CSS: `.cmp-up` (red, spend higher), `.cmp-down` (green, spend lower). Parent `.value-flex` uses `display:flex; align-items:center` for vertical centering.

Comparison `since`/`until` computed by `getPrevPeriodComparison()` → shifts primary period back by one unit, caps elapsed duration at current point. Same bucket granularity as primary query.

### Chart.js external tooltips

Spend-by-Model and Spend-by-Provider use Chart.js `external` tooltip for HTML (provider logos). Injected as `#custom-tooltip`. Inline styles from Chart.js may conflict → use `!important` in CSS.

### Session list UI

Default: summary stats row for the selected time range (sessions, requests, tokens, cost). Full table hidden until **Show list** (`localStorage` key `discursive_usageui_sessions_open`). Long ranges (>1 week) show per-session averages in the list; shorter ranges show individual sessions (max 100).

### Session accounting

- **Event** = one upstream API call (one completion). Logged at DEBUG as `msg=usage`.
- **Agent-task window** = consecutive events until idle (`DefaultIdleTimeout` = 30s, override `DISCURSIVE_USAGE_IDLE`). Logged at INFO as `msg=usage_summary`.
- Pauses >30s mid-agent may split one task → set `DISCURSIVE_USAGE_IDLE=5m` for longer window.
- Session id = gateway process run or explicit CLI session id.
- Persist usage events to SQLite under app data (`{dataRoot}/usage/usage.db`) via `internal/usage/store.go` (schema keepalive: `internal/usage`). No JSONL persistence.
- Log level: `DISCURSIVE_LOG_LEVEL=debug|info|warn|error` (default `info`). Never log secrets.

### CLI spend report (`discursive usage`)

`discursive usage` prints the same blended confirmed+estimated spend as the dashboard
`/api/spend`: Moonshot/DeepSeek MTD/Today (billing-confirmed from balance deltas) + Thaura
MTD (token-estimated). **Z.AI is excluded from the MTD/Today totals** (flat-fee coding plan);
it appears as its own row for information only. Keep CLI + dashboard sums in sync:
any change to which providers feed `Estimated`/headline totals must update both
`internal/cli/usage/confirm.go` and `internal/usageui/spend.go`.

Subcommands:
- `discursive usage purge` — delete `events` rows older than `--max-age` (Go duration, default `90d`); `--dry-run` previews.
- `discursive usage prune-snapshots` — delete `balance_snapshots` rows older than `--max-age` (default `90d`); `--dry-run` previews. Old snapshots are safe to drop once the period they bound is complete (confirmed spend is then already bucketed).

Coverage note: `GET /api/spend?since=...` returns `covered` (true only when both Moonshot
and DeepSeek have a boundary snapshot at `since`, via `Store.PeriodCovered`). Gate any
period-over-period % badge on `covered`, never on the mere presence of spend.


